{"id":"585b23d932148aa0","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame.md","title":"IL框架未必满足ILM条件","display":"ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame — IL框架未必满足ILM条件","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame","aliases":["72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame"],"display":"ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame — IL框架未必满足ILM条件","depends_on":["[[72-df-veltman-forcing]]","[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII Definitions13.3–13.5, print515/PDF527; local four-world countermodel","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame — IL框架未必满足ILM条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e82291b3e069169\" href=\"?note=3e82291b3e069169\" title=\"72-df-veltman-forcing\">72-df-veltman-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"137fba496ea55bfa\" href=\"?note=137fba496ea55bfa\" title=\"72-df-il-ilm-calculi\">72-df-il-ilm-calculi</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII Definitions13.3–13.5, print515/PDF527; local four-world countermodel"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,R,S,V,\\mathfrak V\">\\(W,R,S,V,\\mathfrak V\\)</span> 由下式给出。未单列的赋值指标均取空集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_X:=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_X:=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nW&amp;:=\\{0,1,2,3\\},\\quad R:=\\{\\langle0,1\\rangle,\\langle0,2\\rangle,\\langle0,3\\rangle,\\langle2,3\\rangle\\},\\\\\nS(0)&amp;:=\\operatorname{id}_{\\{1,2,3\\}}\\cup\\{\\langle1,2\\rangle,\\langle2,3\\rangle,\\langle1,3\\rangle\\},\\\\\nS(1)&amp;:=S(3):=\\varnothing,\\qquad S(2):=\\{\\langle3,3\\rangle\\},\\\\\nV(0)&amp;:=\\{1\\},\\quad V(1):=\\{2\\},\\quad V(2):=W\\setminus\\{3\\},\\quad V(i):=\\varnothing\\ (2&lt;i),\\\\\n\\mathfrak V&amp;:=\\langle W,R,S,V\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{MF}(W,R,S).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nW&amp;:=\\{0,1,2,3\\},\\quad R:=\\{\\langle0,1\\rangle,\\langle0,2\\rangle,\\langle0,3\\rangle,\\langle2,3\\rangle\\},\\\\\nS(0)&amp;:=\\operatorname{id}_{\\{1,2,3\\}}\\cup\\{\\langle1,2\\rangle,\\langle2,3\\rangle,\\langle1,3\\rangle\\},\\\\\nS(1)&amp;:=S(3):=\\varnothing,\\qquad S(2):=\\{\\langle3,3\\rangle\\},\\\\\nV(0)&amp;:=\\{1\\},\\quad V(1):=\\{2\\},\\quad V(2):=W\\setminus\\{3\\},\\quad V(i):=\\varnothing\\ (2&lt;i),\\\\\n\\mathfrak V&amp;:=\\langle W,R,S,V\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{MF}(W,R,S).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\bigl(\\mathfrak V,0\\Vdash_I\n[(p_0\\triangleright p_1)\\to_m((p_0\\land_m\\Box_m p_2)\\triangleright(p_1\\land_m\\Box_m p_2))]\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\bigl(\\mathfrak V,0\\Vdash_I\n[(p_0\\triangleright p_1)\\to_m((p_0\\land_m\\Box_m p_2)\\triangleright(p_1\\land_m\\Box_m p_2))]\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R传递且有限无环，每个 S(w) 满足其后继域上的反身传递条件及 R 包含条件。但1S(0)2、2R3，而无1R3，违反 M。所列赋值是前一对应定理的具体四世界见证，能逐世界有限复算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-veltman-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"3e82291b3e069169","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-veltman-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-il-ilm-calculi","status":"resolved","id":"137fba496ea55bfa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"W,R,S,V,\\mathfrak V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}_X:=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nW&:=\\{0,1,2,3\\},\\quad R:=\\{\\langle0,1\\rangle,\\langle0,2\\rangle,\\langle0,3\\rangle,\\langle2,3\\rangle\\},\\\\\nS(0)&:=\\operatorname{id}_{\\{1,2,3\\}}\\cup\\{\\langle1,2\\rangle,\\langle2,3\\rangle,\\langle1,3\\rangle\\},\\\\\nS(1)&:=S(3):=\\varnothing,\\qquad S(2):=\\{\\langle3,3\\rangle\\},\\\\\nV(0)&:=\\{1\\},\\quad V(1):=\\{2\\},\\quad V(2):=W\\setminus\\{3\\},\\quad V(i):=\\varnothing\\ (2<i),\\\\\n\\mathfrak V&:=\\langle W,R,S,V\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{MF}(W,R,S).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\bigl(\\mathfrak V,0\\Vdash_I\n[(p_0\\triangleright p_1)\\to_m((p_0\\land_m\\Box_m p_2)\\triangleright(p_1\\land_m\\Box_m p_2))]\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1836,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"be621e69300ce514","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["3e82291b3e069169","137fba496ea55bfa"]}